1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:01,258
Today is Children's Day
今天是儿童节

2
00:00:01,258 --> 00:00:03,178
I wake up early and feel happy
我很早就醒了感觉很开心

3
00:00:03,178 --> 00:00:04,040
At school
在学校

4
00:00:04,219 --> 00:00:05,777
join my classmates in singing
和我的同学一起唱歌

5
00:00:05,778 --> 00:00:07,559
dancing, and playing games
跳舞，玩游戏

6
00:00:07,618 --> 00:00:08,699
Everyone laughs a lot
每个人都笑得很开心

7
00:00:08,699 --> 00:00:09,580
At noon
中午的时候

8
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,679
we have a special lunch with delicious food
我们有一个特别的午餐有美味的食物

9
00:00:11,958 --> 00:00:12,740
After school
放学后

10
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:15,519
I go home and find many presents in the living room
我回家发现客厅里有许多礼物

11
00:00:15,698 --> 00:00:18,239
My mom and dad gave me toys and books 1 love
我爸爸妈妈给了我玩具和书1爱

12
00:00:18,739 --> 00:00:21,600
I quickly open each gift and feel very happy
我快速打开每个礼物，感到非常高兴

13
00:00:21,658 --> 00:00:23,399
The day goes by fast
一天过得很快

14
00:00:23,498 --> 00:00:25,719
This is a special Children's Day
这是一个特别的儿童节

15
00:00:25,797 --> 00:00:26,498
and I will
我会的。

16
00:00:26,498 --> 00:00:27,442
always remember it
永远记住它

